SparseResultants -- computations with sparse resultants
*******************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides the methods *note sparseResultant: sparseResultant, and
*note sparseDiscriminant: sparseDiscriminant, to calculate sparse resultants
and sparse discriminants. As an application, the method *note
determinant(MultidimensionalMatrix): determinant_lpMultidimensionalMatrix_rp,
is also provided. See also the package *note Resultants: (Resultants)Top,,
which includes methods to calculate dense resultants and dense discriminants.

For the definitions, see one of the following books:

(1) Discriminants, Resultants, and Multidimensional Determinants (see
http://link.springer.com/book/10.1007%2F978-0-8176-4771-1 ), by Israel M.
Gelfand, Mikhail M. Kapranov and Andrei V. Zelevinsky;

(2) Using Algebraic Geometry (see
http://link.springer.com/book/10.1007%2Fb138611 ), by David A. Cox, John
Little, Donal O'shea.

Caveat
======

Currently, most of the algorithms implemented are based on elimination via
Gröbner basis methods. This should be significantly improved by implementing
more specialized algorithms (see e.g. [2 (see
http://link.springer.com/book/10.1007%2Fb138611 ), Chapter 7,Section 6]).

