https://msp.org/jsag/2021/11-1/ ) of The Journal of Software for Algebra and
Geometry (see https://msp.org/jsag/ ) on 5 May 2021, in the article A package
for computations with sparse resultants (see
https://msp.org/jsag/2021/11-1/p07.xhtml ) (DOI: 10.2140/jsag.2021.11.61 (see
https://doi.org/10.2140/jsag.2021.11.61 )). That version can be obtained from
the journal (see https://msp.org/jsag/2021/11-1/jsag-v11-n1-x07-
SparseResultants.m2 ).

