|       : debug with expression   debug 1368   or with command line option   -|
|warning: clearing value of symbol x1 to allow access to subscripted variables|
|       : debug with expression   debug 5513   or with command line option   -|
|warning: clearing value of symbol x0 to allow access to subscripted variables|
|       : debug with expression   debug 6010   or with command line option   -|
