|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     a     }, {a     , a     }, {a     , a     }}, {{a     , a     },        |
|      1,0,1     1,1,0   1,1,1     1,2,0   1,2,1       2,0,0   2,0,1          |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {a     , a     }, {a     , a     }}, {{a     , a     }, {a     ,        |
|       2,1,0   2,1,1     2,2,0   2,2,1       3,0,0   3,0,1     3,1,0         |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     a     }, {a     , a     }}}                                             |
|      3,1,1     3,2,0   3,2,1                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : 3-dimensional matrix of shape 4 x 3 x 2 over ZZ[a     ..a     ]         |
|                                                      0,0,0   3,2,1          |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| based on it                                                                 |
|-debug 1368                                                                  |
| based on it                                                                 |
|-debug 5513                                                                  |
| based on it                                                                 |
|-debug 6010                                                                  |
