SparseDiscriminant Thing -- evaluate a sparse discriminant
**********************************************************

  * Operator: *note SPACE: (Macaulay2Doc)SPACE,
  * Usage: 
        D(F)
  * Inputs:
      * D, an instance of the type *note SparseDiscriminant:
        SparseDiscriminant,, associated to an integral matrix $A$ with $n$
        rows.
      * a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, a Laurent polynomial $F =
        \sum_{\omega\in \{columns\ of\ A\}} a_{\omega} x^{\omega}$ in $n$
        variables $x=(x_1,\ldots,x_n)$.
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the $A$-discriminant
        of $F$.

Description
