  * Operator: *note SPACE: (Macaulay2Doc)SPACE,
  * Usage: 
        R(f)
  * Inputs:
      * R, an instance of the type *note SparseResultant: SparseResultant,,
        associated to $n+1$ integral matrices $A_0,\ldots,A_n$ with $n$ rows.
      * a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, $n+1$ Laurent polynomials $f =
        (f_0,\ldots,f_n)$ in $n$ variables $x=(x_1,\ldots,x_n)$, with $f_i =
        \sum_{\omega\in \{columns\ of\ A_i\}} a_{i,\omega} x^{\omega}$.
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the
        $(A_0,\ldots,A_n)$-resultant of $f_0,\ldots,f_n$.

