|i2 : f = genericLaurentPolynomials(2,3)                                      |
|                                                                             |
|         2                 3      2                                          |
|o2 = (a x  + a x  + a , b x  + b x  + b x  + b )                             |
|       2 1    1 1    0   3 1    2 1    1 1    0                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
