|o3 = a b  - a a b b  + a a b  + a a b b  - 2a a b b  - a a a b b  + a a b  - |
|      2 0    1 2 0 1    0 2 1    1 2 0 2     0 2 0 2    0 1 2 1 2    0 2 2   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      3                        2         2          2          3 2           |
|     a b b  + 3a a a b b  + a a b b  - 2a a b b  - a a b b  + a b            |
|      1 0 3     0 1 2 0 3    0 1 1 3     0 2 1 3    0 1 2 3    0 3           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : ZZ[a ..a , b ..b ]                                                      |
